    "App 直接连接你指定的路由器，没有云端账户、广告或分析 SDK，也不向开发者服务器上传路由器数据。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "App 直接连接你指定的路由器，没有云端账户、广告或分析 SDK，也不向开发者服务器上传路由器数据。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The app connects directly to the router you specify. There are no cloud accounts, ads, or analytics SDKs, and no router data is uploaded to developer servers."
          }
        }
      }
    },
