    "主机密钥与记录不一致，可能存在安全风险。预期指纹：%@；实际指纹：%@。请先核对路由器无误，再更新档案中的记录。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "主机密钥与记录不一致，可能存在安全风险。预期指纹：%@；实际指纹：%@。请先核对路由器无误，再更新档案中的记录。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The host key does not match the saved record, which may be a security risk. Expected fingerprint: %@; actual fingerprint: %@. Verify the router before updating the saved record."
