    "允许本地网络访问后重试。访客 Wi-Fi、客户端隔离、VPN 或防火墙可能阻止访问。扫描只检查当前 Wi-Fi 网段的 Web 端口，不保证找到所有路由器。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许本地网络访问后重试。访客 Wi-Fi、客户端隔离、VPN 或防火墙可能阻止访问。扫描只检查当前 Wi-Fi 网段的 Web 端口，不保证找到所有路由器。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Allow local network access and try again. Guest Wi-Fi, client isolation, a VPN, or a firewall may block access. The scan only checks web ports on the current Wi-Fi subnet and may not find every router."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "允许访问本地网络后，返回这里重新扫描。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "允许访问本地网络后，返回这里重新扫描。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "After allowing local network access, return here to scan again."
          }
        }
      }
    },
