    "在线升级": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线升级"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online Upgrade"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在线升级为高风险操作：下方入口严格执行加强事务——自动备份 → 镜像哈希校验 → 镜像合法性校验 → 二次确认 → 升级 → 自动重连验证，缺一不可。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在线升级为高风险操作：下方入口严格执行加强事务——自动备份 → 镜像哈希校验 → 镜像合法性校验 → 二次确认 → 升级 → 自动重连验证，缺一不可。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Online upgrade is high-risk: the entry below strictly runs the enhanced transaction — automatic backup → image hash check → image validity check → second confirmation → upgrade → automatic reconnection verification. No step may be skipped."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "在连接页长按已保存的路由器，选择删除并确认，可移除此 App 保存的对应地址记录和钥匙串凭据。断开连接会清除本次会话的数据及最近活动，不更改路由器配置。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在连接页长按已保存的路由器，选择删除并确认，可移除此 App 保存的对应地址记录和钥匙串凭据。断开连接会清除本次会话的数据及最近活动，不更改路由器配置。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "On the Connect page, long-press a saved router and choose Delete to remove the address record and Keychain credentials this app saved for it. Disconnecting clears this session’s data and recent activity without changing router configuration."
          }
        }
      }
    },
