    "备份与校验已完成。再次确认后将真正执行升级——升级期间全屋断网，路由器自动重启。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "备份与校验已完成。再次确认后将真正执行升级——升级期间全屋断网，路由器自动重启。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Backup and verification are complete. Confirming again will actually run the upgrade — the whole home network will be offline during the upgrade and the router will reboot automatically."
          }
        }
      }
    },
