    "插件服务页提供启动、停止、重启及开机启动操作。只有路由器确认请求成功后才显示执行结果；请同时核对服务运行状态。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件服务页提供启动、停止、重启及开机启动操作。只有路由器确认请求成功后才显示执行结果；请同时核对服务运行状态。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plugin service pages offer start, stop, restart, and start-on-boot actions. Results are shown only after the router confirms the request succeeded; also check the service’s running state."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "插件目录从已安装软件包读取，包含版本、依赖和关联配置。运行实例不代表插件配置已生效，也不代表业务可用。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "插件目录从已安装软件包读取，包含版本、依赖和关联配置。运行实例不代表插件配置已生效，也不代表业务可用。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "The plugin catalog is read from installed packages and includes versions, dependencies, and associated configurations. A running instance does not mean the plugin configuration has taken effect, nor that the service is usable."
