    "登录时，用户名和密码发送到你指定的路由器，用于建立 ubus 会话。会话和读取的设备、网络及服务信息保留在当前进程内存中；断开连接后清除。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "登录时，用户名和密码发送到你指定的路由器，用于建立 ubus 会话。会话和读取的设备、网络及服务信息保留在当前进程内存中；断开连接后清除。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "When you sign in, the username and password are sent to the router you specified to establish a ubus session. The session and the device, network, and service information read are kept in this process’s memory and cleared when you disconnect."
          }
        }
      }
    },
