    "配置草稿保留在当前进程内存中。只有你预览并确认应用后，App 才将修改提交到路由器；服务操作也需要单独确认。配置内容可能包含敏感信息，请谨慎展示和分享。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置草稿保留在当前进程内存中。只有你预览并确认应用后，App 才将修改提交到路由器；服务操作也需要单独确认。配置内容可能包含敏感信息，请谨慎展示和分享。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configuration drafts are kept in this process’s memory. Only after you preview and confirm Apply does the app commit changes to the router; service actions also need separate confirmation. Configuration contents may include sensitive information — display and share with care."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "配置页面直接编辑路由器返回的 UCI 字段。应用修改前可预览；应用后需在 90 秒内验证连接并确认保留。修改网络或管理访问可能导致连接中断。": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "配置页面直接编辑路由器返回的 UCI 字段。应用修改前可预览；应用后需在 90 秒内验证连接并确认保留。修改网络或管理访问可能导致连接中断。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Configuration pages edit the UCI fields returned by the router directly. Preview before applying; after applying, verify the connection and confirm keeping the changes within 90 seconds. Changing network or management access may interrupt the connection."
          }
        }
      }
    },
